WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.690
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.860
You seem pleased, Yuzu.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:17.080
You bet! My bestest friend is finally coming back!

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.700
She certainly is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.080
It's been a long half year.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.410
You must be excited.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.330
Yeah!

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.710
I can barely wait!

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:28.130
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.050
It's gotten a lot cooler. {those fucking heads}

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.550
Perfect weather for running.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.010
It's the autumn of sports!

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.130
Not quite!

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.260
It's the autumn of Aikatsu!

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.680
Wh-What was that?

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.390
Did winter just blow in?

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:44.440
It's way too early for that.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.610
A-Again?

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:58.280
She's the Tundra Diva, Shirogane Lily-san!

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:41.930
I'm shivering.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:42.850
She's...

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.350
What is this intensity?

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:50.850
Koharu!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.270
Stay with us!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.400
Koharu-chan!

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.730
Stay awake! Don't fall asleep!

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.360
Lilienne!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.360
I missed you!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:00.700
Lilienne!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.740
Geez!

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:09.250
Yuzu, had I taken the full brunt of your tackle, I would have gone back on medical leave.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.630
Ah, sorry. I was just so happy to see you.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.500
As am I.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.630
Excuse me. You're Lily-senpai, right?

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:19.510
And you are?

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.340
It's nice to meet you. I'm a 
Song Class first-year, Nijino Yume.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.890
I've been wanting to meet you.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.640
Why?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:31.890
I watched one of your performances that the library had on record.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:35.900
Yume-chan's dream is to join S4. Right?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.150
Yes!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.910
Like a wilting flower,

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.740
the emergence of conflict is saddening.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:52.960
Yet, if that is to be my destiny, I shall not turn my back to it.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.380
I will strike down any who encroach upon my path by these two hands.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.920
She's saying that she's not gonna lose.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.550
Lilienne's dream is also to get into S4.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.550
R-Right.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.510
Yuzu, let us go.

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.560
Sure! See you later.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.560
I know people were talking up her uniqueness...

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.400
...but this is even more than I imagined.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.320
Good morning!

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.320
The Headmaster's away on business today!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:27.450
So in his stead, I'll play you some sick riffs on my guitar!

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.830
Yay!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.210
That's some nice rock!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.290
Anna-sensei's in the zone!

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:40.340
It doesn't sound like she's going to stop any time soon.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.600
I managed to make it in time.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.850
Lily-senpai!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.810
She detected Lily-chan collapsing in an instant

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.860
and slid in at the last second to cushion her fall!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.240
Nobody's reflexes are as good as yours, Yuzu-sama!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.860
You all right, Lilienne?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.240
Nice catch.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:11.870
I haven't known you forever for nothing.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:12.750
Hey!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:17.750
Sorry, baby! Bring her to the infirmary ASAP! Let's go!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.340
Roger!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.880
Will she be okay?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.510
Later.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.140
Yuzu-senpai.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.140
Huh? What's up?

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.520
We were worried about Lily-senpai.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.390
How is she feeling?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.150
Just fine. This is usual for her.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.770
She always used to collapse during the morning assembly.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.780
Rides were a one-way ticket to getting sick.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.030
Not to mention she's never made it to the end of an outing.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:51.280
And every time a bug went around, she'd be sure to catch it.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:55.790
Still, she's a lot healthier now compared to back then.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.290
Really?

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.330
Despite this?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.630
Lily-senpai's been recuperating up at the plateau, right?

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:08.800
Yeah. I heard that she made it all the way to the finals in last year's S4 Selection,

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.390
but she had to drop out because of health issues.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.810
That's too bad.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.180
Having a weak constitution is a pretty big handicap.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.310
Yeah.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:22.820
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.070
C-Could this be?

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.360
Lily-senpai!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.580
Lily! Are you better now?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.950
Yes, I recovered in the infirmary.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:40.370
I have arrived to participate in the lesson.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:43.840
Since most of you first-years don't know her, let me introduce her.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:49.090
This is Shirogane Lily. She's a second-year like me, along with being the other Song Class admin.{it's hard to word this so that it's not ambiguous that "the other song class admin" is lily}

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.090
She's so pretty!

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.640
Quiet!

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:56.100
Lily's been on break for a while to recuperate,

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.520
but she's back starting today.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:01.350
It is my honor to be here.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.860
Sh-She's overpowering!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.530
What kind of Aikatsu will the Tundra Diva show us?

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.950
I can't wait!{I don't think I've ever let you use the exact phrase "I'm excited to see"}

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.200
We'll begin with twenty push-ups!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.120
Yes!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:22.630
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.720
What's wrong?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.890
My apologies. It appears my body does not wish to cooperate.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.060
Allow me to simply observe.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:46.020
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:51.030
<i>Just warming up tired her out.</i>

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:54.530
<i>I wonder if she's not fully recovered yet.</i>

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.780
There! Now turn!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.250
Ow...

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.910
Yume! Are you okay?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.170
Y-Yeah.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:04.880
It's just a little fall.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.920
Ouch...

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.300
Yume!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:11.670
Nijino-san, go to the infirmary right away.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:14.180
But we're in the middle of a lesson.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.680
Don't overwork yourself.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:18.470
Okay...

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.060
It's a sprain.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:28.070
You'll heal in a week's time with cold compresses.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.690
That's a relief.

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.360
But in the meantime, you're prohibited from physical activity.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.150
What?!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:36.070
Healing injuries fully is an important part of Aikatsu.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.530
Let it rest for the next week.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:39.700
Okay...

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.580
I see, so you'll be out for a week.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.580
You're lucky it isn't any longer.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.090
Well, it's not like you had any performances lined up.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.920
Just take it easy.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:51.840
Yeah.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:58.600
Everyone, we're starting a new dance step today.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.390
<i>A new dance step.</i>

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.610
We'll start with the step-in.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:23.120
One, two, One, two. One, two.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:28.630
<i>It's no good. I won't be able to learn it without dancing!</i>

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.800
Is Shirogane Lily here?

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.180
I've got some big news!

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:42.180
Yes, I'm present.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:47.190
The news that you came back leaked on KirakiLine.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:54.240
Your fans have been showering us with a constant stream of impassioned requests for a show.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.690
And so!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:10:00.570
Tomorrow we'll be holding a 
Shirogane Lily revival concert!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.700
Yay!

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.450
Tomorrow?! On such short notice?

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.830
Well, Shirogane? Are you in?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.580
Naturally. It is for that purpose

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.090
that I have returned to Four Star Academy.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:21.510
Yume! We'll be able to see Lily-senpai sing in person!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:22.850
Isn't that great?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:23.970
Yeah!

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.740
We've got a big announcement for you all today!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:49.460
Do you know the Four Star Academy second-year, Shirogane Lily-chan?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:54.880
She's finally back, half a year after her strong showing in the last S4 Selection.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.630
And her revival concert is tomorrow.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:01.340
Shirogane Lily's revival concert!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.140
Please come and watch!

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:11.400
And so, I'd like to enlist the help of the admins to organize Lily's concert tomorrow.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.650
Would you lend a hand?

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:17.400
Of course! We'll gladly give our assistance.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:21.110
It's kind of crazy to see every class's admins in one place.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:24.530
It just goes to show how much attention Lily-senpai is gettting.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.290
There's no way we can afford to miss her performance.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.410
Yume-chan?

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.120
Yeah?

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.540
What's wrong? You're spacing out.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.790
Is there something on your mind?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:38.300
No, nothing at all.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:42.510
Excuse me.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.550
Nurse... {yes?}{yes}

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.560
Huh?

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.680
The nurse is out.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.100
Lily-senpai.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.060
She took her leave a moment ago.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:56.070
There was a patient she had to attend to.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.690
I see.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.030
What brings you here?

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:03.320
Oh, well, I wanted to change out my compress.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.570
You can find them over there.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:10.080
Bandages and tape are in the cabinet's drawers as well.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.340
Huh?

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:17.800
Can you handle it?

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.210
Oh, yes, somehow.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:24.470
Still, I was surprised you knew where the bandages and such were.

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.100
Ever since I enrolled,

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.600
I've been a frequent visitor.

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:31.390
So you have.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.730
U-Um...

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.490
Does it ever worry you, Lily-senpai?

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:47.740
You were away from school for half a year, and couldn't even train your Aikatsu.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:54.500
I have to rest for a week, and can't do Aikatsu with everyone else.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.630
I'm kind of panicking.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.750
Have you ever felt like that?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.260
Must you do it with everyone else?

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.770
We each have our own differences. {OP 1 line}

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:17.980
Sensitivity, memory, athleticism, stamina,

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:22.820
looks, figure, and the timbre and power of our voices.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:29.530
As we have various uniquenesses, it is only natural for our methods of training to be varied.

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.160
Uniqueness...

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:35.330
There is much to gain from lessons with others.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:40.670
However, when you cannot partake in them, you must devote yourself to what you can.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.090
That is the essence of self-production.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.680
I get the concept...

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:51.680
I cannot take the same lessons or train like everybody else.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:55.520
Thus, some heartless people have said certain things to me.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.690
That I could not be an idol.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:13:59.730
That's—

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.650
Ow...

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.650
That is just one opinion. {nah, present tense}

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:10.370
Everyone is free to have their own.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.870
Isn't it painful?

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:22.210
When I begin to feel that way,

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:26.010
I imagine a world and tell myself:

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.180
I am in a frozen landscape.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:35.060
Locked away by the relentless winter, I have nowhere to go, no path to take.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:39.020
Scream as I may, my voice vanishes into the blizzard.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.770
However, now is the time to endure.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.900
The snow will one day melt.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:51.030
Just as there is no night without dawn, beyond every winter awaits spring.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.290
Until then, I shall continue to sing.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.160
No matter what ills befall my body,

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:01.920
I will allow no one to take my dream away.{by the way, petition for title change to "A Dream They Can't Take Away" for real this time}

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.170
Was that overly opaque?

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.630
No, I really get you!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:09.300
Huh?

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:14.930
I imagine too, about having followed Hime-senpai's footsteps into S4.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.480
My CDs sell out on day one!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:22.520
My song echoes all around the city,

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:26.440
bringing smiles to crying children, angry people, and everyone else!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:29.440
And then comes world peace!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:35.450
Just kidding. But I am pretty serious about wanting to see it happen.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.620
Your imaginations sound fun.{this is kind of an archaic usage of the word imagination, but lily so I guess it's okay?}

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.960
But imagination alone will not change anything.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:47.960
I will make tomorrow's concert a success and turn my imagination into reality.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.170
Now then.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.340
Take care.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:08.230
This is amazing. I can't believe so many people gathered with just a day's notice.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:13.320
A half-year hiatus would put most idols at a huge disadvantage.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.620
What could be attracting so many fans?

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.740
<i>Lily-senpai...</i>

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.580
It's time.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:21.750
Yes.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.120
Don't worry, you'll be fine!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.920
On what basis?

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:30.630
Knowing you, you've been training the entire time you were on leave.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.180
Don't think I don't know.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:36.350
Even if you can't keep up with everyone else during lessons,

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.510
you train more than anyone else on your own.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.060
You'll be fine, Lilienne.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.400
I know you can do this.

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:50.230
If you're this confident, it must be true.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.030
You can bet on it!

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.280
<i>The Green Shadow Coord.</i>

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.540
<i>This will be my dress.</i>

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:06.540
Shirogane Lily, pouring my soul into this moment!

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.680
I felt a shiver.

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.890
It's like she was never on hiatus.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:16.770
So this is the talent behind the Tundra Diva.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:17.980
That's not it.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:18.780
What?

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.110
She does have talent.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.900
But that's not all!

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.070
Great job!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.780
Good work.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.330
Thank you very...

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:34.670
Yuzu.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.960
Lilienne, you did awesome!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.300
Yuzu, was I able to pay it back?

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.630
To the people who lent me their support,

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:47.050
to the people who waited this half year.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:53.230
Did my gratitude and appreciation shine through?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.690
Don't their cheers tell you all you need to know?

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:03.570
See?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.160
But it's not like I expected otherwise!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:16.250
You're a future member of S4!

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.000
Naturally.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:24.260
This was but the first new step towards the beginning of Shirogane Lily's legend.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.890
Lily-senpai!{why are they seemingly allowed places other first-years aren't}

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:31.010
Your performance overwhelmed me!

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:33.770
It almost made me think I could never catch you.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.770
But I'm not going to give up.

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:41.690
Because my dream is also to join S4.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:43.780
I'll do my best!

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.490
A declaration of war?

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:48.530
No, that's not what I...

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:50.490
A friend by the name of rival.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:54.790
It is a famous line from a well-known story. {Fist of the North Star, apparently}{I wouldn't be surprised if that used it from something else}

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:57.580
Written as "rival", read as "friend".

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:03.550
It means that formidable rivals are able to hone one another's skills to reach greater heights.

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:05.550
There's our proverb!

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:08.300
I welcome you as my rival.

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:10.470
Let us each do our best.

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:14.350
Yes! Thank you very much, Lily-senpai!

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:12.840
How do you view yourself in S4, Nijino-san?

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:15.260
No doubt, I want to be like Hime-senpai...

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:17.600
Is that truly what you wish for?

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:18.600
Huh?

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:20.310
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:22.560
The Tale of a Tiny Dress.

00:24:22.560 --> 00:24:24.690
Become the first-star idol!
